</script>
<template><div class="login-page"><div class="login-orb orb-one"></div><div class="login-orb orb-two"></div><section class="login-showcase"><div class="showcase-brand"><div class="brand-mark large">寓</div><div><strong>长租云管家</strong><span>PROPERTY RENTAL PLATFORM</span></div></div><div class="showcase-copy"><span class="eyebrow">智能租赁运营平台</span><h1>让每一套房源<br><em>高效、安全地运营</em></h1><p>房源、租约、账单、押金、维修和退租结算，一套系统形成完整业务闭环。</p><div class="feature-grid"><div><b>01</b><span>租约冲突自动校验</span></div><div><b>02</b><span>资金流水事务保障</span></div><div><b>03</b><span>关键操作全程审计</span></div></div></div><p class="showcase-foot">面向房东与公寓运营方的专业管理工具</p></section><section class="login-panel"><div class="login-card"><div class="mobile-brand"><div class="brand-mark">寓</div><strong>长租云管家</strong></div><span class="welcome">WELCOME BACK</span><h2>欢迎登录</h2><p class="login-tip">请输入账号信息进入管理后台</p><form @submit.prevent="submit"><label>用户名<div class="input-wrap"><span>♙</span><input v-model="username" autocomplete="username" placeholder="请输入用户名"></div></label><label>密码<div class="input-wrap"><span>◇</span><input v-model="password" autocomplete="current-password" type="password" placeholder="请输入密码"></div></label><div class="local-account"><span>本地验收账号</span><code>admin / Admin123!</code></div><p v-if="error" class="form-error">{{error}}</p><button class="login-button" :disabled="loading">{{loading?'正在登录...':'登录管理后台'}}<span>→</span></button><button type="button" class="ghost-button" @click="router.push('/register')">注册新账号</button></form><p class="security-note">密码采用 bcrypt 加密存储，请勿在生产环境使用默认账号。</p></div></section></div></template>
